stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> Quoted: calculate
    Quoted --> AwaitingConfirmation: select
    AwaitingConfirmation --> Accepted: confirm and validate
    AwaitingConfirmation --> Expired: validity ends
    Accepted --> Modifying: change requested
    Modifying --> Accepted: change committed
    Accepted --> Cancelling: cancel requested
    Cancelling --> Cancelled: compensate and commit
    Accepted --> Fulfilled: completion confirmed
    Fulfilled --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
    Expired --> [*]

